#: src/Privacy/PrivacyPolicy.php:50
msgid "This site provides a private area that is only available to signed-in users. To decide what each user may see, the site records which roles a page, dashboard or document is available to, and reads the account you are signed in with. This information stays on this site and is not sent anywhere else."
